1
00:00:03,440 --> 00:00:06,720
尽管把宝宝从医院带回家是件幸福的事
As great as it is bringing a baby home from the hospital,

2
00:00:06,720 --> 00:00:10,600
有种声音绝对是你醒来时恐惧面对的
there's one sound you absolutely dread waking up to...

3
00:00:14,680 --> 00:00:15,280
亲戚们
Relatives.

4
00:00:18,816 --> 00:00:22,100
我还真没见过这些婚礼照片 妈妈
I really never saw these wedding pictures, mamá.

5
00:00:22,100 --> 00:00:24,420
爸爸看起来多年轻潇洒啊
How handsome and young papa looks.

6
00:00:24,420 --> 00:00:26,851
看得我好伤感
Ay, it makes me sad.

7
00:00:26,851 --> 00:00:28,820
我知道你想念他
Ay, I know that you miss him.

8
00:00:28,820 --> 00:00:30,320
不是 你看我的翘臀
No. Look at my ass.

9
00:00:30,760 --> 00:00:32,740
照片里有两样东西 现在我都失去了
There are two things in that picture I don't have anymore.

10
00:00:32,740 --> 00:00:34,460
妈妈 您太搞笑了
Ay, mama, que loca.

11
00:00:34,460 --> 00:00:35,600
桑娅 需要我帮忙吗
Sonia, can I help you?

12
00:00:35,800 --> 00:00:37,640
没事 没事 让她忙去吧
No, no, she's fine. It keeps her busy.

13
00:00:37,640 --> 00:00:40,080
得再来点玉米 歌洛莉亚 菜园在哪
We need more corn. Gloria, where is your garden?

14
00:00:40,080 --> 00:00:40,880
我去摘点儿
I will harvest some.

15
00:00:41,040 --> 00:00:42,460
宝贝儿 城里人家里可没菜园
They don't live that way, honey.

16
00:00:42,540 --> 00:00:44,300
歌洛莉亚 给我车钥匙 我们去趟超市
Gloria, give me the keys. We'll go to the market.

17
00:00:44,420 --> 00:00:46,280
嘿 你们都起床啦 我都没听见你们的动静
Hey, you're all awake. I didn't hear you.

18
00:00:46,400 --> 00:00:48,760
看看我们家两个帅哥
Oh, look at my two handsome men.

19
00:00:48,760 --> 00:00:51,440
我的宝贝 我的小弗汉希欧·翁贝托
Mi nio, my little Fulgencio Umberto.

20
00:00:51,440 --> 00:00:52,840
说到名字 我们还没完全确定...
You know, about the name, we're not entirely sure...

21
00:00:52,840 --> 00:00:56,163
桑娅 走啦 再见哟 弗汉希欧
Sonia, vámonos. Good-bye, Fulgencio.

22
00:00:56,163 --> 00:00:57,872
跟弗汉希欧再见
Say good-bye to Fulgencio.

23
00:00:58,082 --> 00:00:59,400
再见 弗汉希欧
Good-bye, Fulgencio.

24
00:00:59,400 --> 00:01:00,520
他的名字叫乔
His name is Joe.

25
00:01:00,840 --> 00:01:03,020
你去告诉她我们不会用她去世的老公
You tell her that we're not naming him

26
00:01:03,020 --> 00:01:06,020
或他爹的名字给孩子取名
after her dead husband or his father before him.

27
00:01:06,060 --> 00:01:07,760
-他的名字是 -别说了
- His name was-- - Please don't say it again.

28
00:01:07,940 --> 00:01:10,780
杰 我不能违背我妈妈的愿望
Jay, I cannot go against my mother's will.

29
00:01:11,120 --> 00:01:12,680
但她喜欢你
But she likes you.

30
00:01:12,800 --> 00:01:14,560
如果你去劝她
Maybe if you convince her...

31
00:01:14,569 --> 00:01:17,940
弗汉希欧·翁贝托--缩写是F.U.普里契特
Fulgencio Umberto-- the initials are F.U. Pritchett,

32
00:01:17,940 --> 00:01:20,200
我现在就是这种操蛋的感觉
which is exactly the way it feels right now.

33
00:01:32,840 --> 00:01:35,520
教父教母有什么着装要求吗
Is there some kind of dress code for godparents?

34
00:01:35,740 --> 00:01:36,820
不许戴你那顶大傻帽子 菲尔
You're not wearing a fedora, Phil.

35
00:01:36,920 --> 00:01:37,880
你能去取下干洗的衣服吗
Can you pick up the dry cleaning?

36
00:01:38,120 --> 00:01:40,460
听起来我好像不能拒绝啊
That sounds like an offer I can't refuse.

37
00:01:41,060 --> 00:01:42,340
别 我们不搞这一套
Yeah, we're not doing that.

38
00:01:42,660 --> 00:01:45,000
我接莉莉下舞蹈课已经迟到了
So I got delayed picking up Lily from dance class.

39
00:01:45,080 --> 00:01:46,320
现在歌洛莉亚又叫我到处跑
Now Gloria's got me running around

40
00:01:46,320 --> 00:01:47,660
准备一堆洗礼的事
doing a thousand things for christening.

41
00:01:48,160 --> 00:01:49,040
操他妈的
Son of a bitch.

42
00:01:49,040 --> 00:01:51,663
别激动 我只是发发牢骚而已
It's not that bad, really. I'm just--I'm venting.

43
00:01:51,800 --> 00:01:53,240
难以置信 有人把气球
I couldn't believe it. Somebody's balloons

44
00:01:53,240 --> 00:01:55,043
挡到我的广告牌了 菲尔牌
were blocking my billboard. Philboard.

45
00:01:55,043 --> 00:01:56,320
我的菲尔牌
My Philboard.

46
00:01:57,480 --> 00:01:59,700
我们能把穿去参加洗礼的衣服
Can we wear the same outfits at Crispin's party

47
00:01:59,700 --> 00:02:00,780
穿到克里斯宾的派对上吗
that we're wearing to the baptism?

48
00:02:01,380 --> 00:02:02,460
这个啊 我也不知道
Oh, you know what? I don't know.

49
00:02:02,469 --> 00:02:03,951
因为你想在教堂低调
Because you wanna be subdued at church

50
00:02:03,960 --> 00:02:05,220
到了晚上却很华丽
and then fabulous at night.

51
00:02:05,320 --> 00:02:06,300
你知道谁会狠赚一笔吗
You know who would make a fortune?

52
00:02:06,460 --> 00:02:08,660
给男人设计小黑裙的设计师
The designer who comes up with the little black dress for men.

53
00:02:09,700 --> 00:02:10,500
我好无聊
I'm bored.

54
00:02:10,660 --> 00:02:12,380
我知道 小甜心 但是爸爸们在讨论
I know, sweetie, but daddies are talking

55
00:02:12,380 --> 00:02:13,891
我们晚上要穿什么
about what we're gonna wear tonight,

56
00:02:13,900 --> 00:02:15,380
那可是很难做决定的
and that's a difficult conversation.

57
00:02:15,380 --> 00:02:17,672
-难死了也跟本小姐无关 -莉莉
- Cry me a river. - Lily.

58
00:02:18,118 --> 00:02:19,860
我不喜欢你这样哦
I-I'm not loving this attitude.

59
00:02:19,860 --> 00:02:20,820
你这样显得有点刻薄
You seem a little mean.

60
00:02:20,820 --> 00:02:24,198
对不起 需要我帮你们叫辆"救父车"吗
Sorry. Should I call you a wah-mbulance?

61
00:02:25,260 --> 00:02:27,880
我的天啊 她最近好毒舌啊
Oh, my gosh. She has been so snarky lately.

62
00:02:27,960 --> 00:02:29,380
是啊 现在只要一害她迟到
I know. I've actually been getting nervous

63
00:02:29,380 --> 00:02:30,820
我的神经就很紧张
when we're making her late for something.

64
00:02:30,900 --> 00:02:32,120
因为她那天说的话吗
Because of what she said the other day?

65
00:02:32,240 --> 00:02:33,800
-"抓紧时间 小姐们" -真伤人
- "Today, ladies." - Hurtful.

66
00:02:34,340 --> 00:02:36,800
你也知道 她听到我们那样说话
You know, she hears us doing it,

67
00:02:37,307 --> 00:02:39,851
所以我们 我们不该造成那么多负面影响
So we--we should try and be less negative.

68
00:02:40,120 --> 00:02:41,140
做好榜样
Model some better behavior.

69
00:02:41,460 --> 00:02:43,680
是啊 如果她需要的是一名模特
Yeah. Well, you know, if it's a model she needs,

70
00:02:43,700 --> 00:02:44,740
那她就来对地方了
She's come to the right place.

71
00:02:44,740 --> 00:02:45,691
-妈呀 -哼
- Oh, boy. - Hmm.

72
00:02:47,220 --> 00:02:48,640
要是莉莉在就好了
I wish Lily was in here,

73
00:02:48,640 --> 00:02:50,480
她就可以看到我对这事不予置评
so she could hear me not comment on that.

74
00:02:50,660 --> 00:02:52,020
知道啦 你在扮模特走秀
I get it. You're modeling.

75
00:02:52,960 --> 00:02:55,100
嘿 又是我 菲尔·邓菲
Hey, it's Phil Dunphy again.

76
00:02:55,919 --> 00:02:57,567
你的电话断线了
I-I got cut off by your machine.

77
00:02:57,567 --> 00:02:59,620
不知道刚刚说到哪了
I'm, uh, not sure where I left off there,

78
00:02:59,620 --> 00:03:00,780
但我尽量长话短说
but I'll attempt to be brief,

79
00:03:00,840 --> 00:03:03,240
因为别人这么做我也会很感激
As I do appreciate when people do the same for me.

80
00:03:03,615 --> 00:03:07,440
话说回来 你的气球挡住--妈的
Anyhoo, uh, your balloons are co--damn it!

81
00:03:07,440 --> 00:03:09,180
有人在家吗 妈
Is anyone home? Mom!

82
00:03:09,300 --> 00:03:10,600
我先找她的 妈
I need her first. Mom!

83
00:03:10,680 --> 00:03:11,200
她出去了
She's out.

84
00:03:11,380 --> 00:03:12,920
我们需要一个成年人的时候她怎么老不在
Why is she always gone when we need an adult?

85
00:03:12,980 --> 00:03:14,840
-我可以帮忙 -盒子里是什么
- I can help. - What's with the cage?

86
00:03:15,040 --> 00:03:16,740
-科研项目 -妈 你在哪里
- Science project. - Mom, where are you?

87
00:03:16,740 --> 00:03:18,600
-出去了 就我们三个在 -四个
- Out. It's just the three of us. - Four.

88
00:03:18,600 --> 00:03:20,080
-我需要她 -是老鼠
- I need her. - Rats.

89
00:03:20,340 --> 00:03:21,060
我知道 好吧
I know, right?

90
00:03:21,220 --> 00:03:22,840
同志们 我就在这里 你们需要什么
Guys, I'm right here. What do you need?

91
00:03:22,840 --> 00:03:23,441
没事 我们没事
No, it's okay. We're good.

92
00:03:23,441 --> 00:03:25,940
-没事 -不 不不不不不
- Okay, never mind. - No. No, no, no, no, no, no, no.

93
00:03:25,940 --> 00:03:27,700
家庭会议 每人抓块披萨
Family meeting. Everybody grab some 'za.

94
00:03:27,700 --> 00:03:29,518
一起讨论下这个问题
We're gonna talk about this.

95
00:03:31,660 --> 00:03:33,680
听着 我知道你们喜欢找妈妈
Listen, I know you guys like to go to mom,

96
00:03:33,680 --> 00:03:35,820
因为她是问题解决小能手
because she's Mr.Tough guy problem-solver.

97
00:03:35,820 --> 00:03:36,520
她办事有结果
She gets results.

98
00:03:36,740 --> 00:03:38,640
对 她有 她有 你没错
Yeah, she does. She does. You're right.

99
00:03:39,260 --> 00:03:41,500
比如上次 我们买到了最喜欢吃的披萨
Like the last time we got pizza from our favorite place here.

100
00:03:41,520 --> 00:03:42,920
还记得那次吗 他们少找了我们零钱
Remember that? We got shortchanged,

101
00:03:43,000 --> 00:03:45,080
她连珠炮似的骂了一通 把钱要回来了
She cursed a blue streak and got our money back?

102
00:03:45,740 --> 00:03:46,960
顺便问下 披萨好吃吗
How's that pizza, by the way?

103
00:03:46,970 --> 00:03:48,816
-挺好的 不错 -撒谎
- Pretty good. It's okay. - Liars!

104
00:03:48,960 --> 00:03:50,000
难吃死了
It's garbage.

105
00:03:50,740 --> 00:03:52,840
那不是斯卡迪诺家的披萨 是斯卡多尼的
That's not Scardino's, it's Scandoni's.

106
00:03:52,840 --> 00:03:53,760
你们知道为什么吗
You know why?

107
00:03:53,961 --> 00:03:55,780
因为你们老妈的小脾气得罪他家了
'cause your mom's little blow-up

108
00:03:55,780 --> 00:03:59,780
我们这辈子都吃不到斯卡迪诺家的披萨了
got us banned from Scardino's for life.

109
00:04:00,040 --> 00:04:02,360
所以 也许老妈的办法并非总是最好的
So maybe your mom's way isn't always the best way.

110
00:04:02,760 --> 00:04:04,560
现在 你们跟我说说发生什么事了
Now why don't you guys tell me what's going on?

111
00:04:04,881 --> 00:04:07,450
我本来打算下周办一场60年代主题生日派对
I'm having a '60s-themed birthday party next week.

112
00:04:07,450 --> 00:04:09,522
嬉皮士 喇叭裤 扎染什么的
Hippies, bell-bottoms, tie-dye.

113
00:04:09,760 --> 00:04:10,960
凯伦·苏利文知道了
Karen Sullivan heard about it,

114
00:04:10,960 --> 00:04:13,360
决定办一场同样的派对 就在今晚
and decided to have the same party... tonight.

115
00:04:14,100 --> 00:04:14,860
情况不妙
Not groovy.

116
00:04:15,440 --> 00:04:17,180
我一不留神把我"老师"叫成了"老妈"
I accidentally called my teacher "Mommy".

117
00:04:17,180 --> 00:04:20,455
我"朋友"罗本到处宣传 全校都知道了
My "Friend" Reuben went around and told everyone.

118
00:04:20,863 --> 00:04:22,200
我说 罗本
Oh, hey, Reuben,

119
00:04:22,200 --> 00:04:24,120
你还记不记得那次全班到动物园郊游
do you remember that class field trip to the zoo

120
00:04:24,120 --> 00:04:26,360
有只斑马从栅栏里冲出来 你都尿裤子了
when the zebra rushed the fence and you peed your pants?

121
00:04:26,880 --> 00:04:29,620
我都没告诉任何人 就算他在坐车回家的时候
I didn't tell anyone, not even on the bus ride home

122
00:04:29,620 --> 00:04:30,995
不得不坐在老妈旁边...
when he had to sit next to mom--

123
00:04:30,995 --> 00:04:32,880
不对 是鲍克曼老师 该死
Ms. Bockman! Damn it!

124
00:04:32,880 --> 00:04:34,060
我们邻居出远门了
Our neighbor's out of town,

125
00:04:34,060 --> 00:04:36,500
所以她雇我在街道清扫日那天替她挪车
and she's paying me to move her car on street cleaning days.

126
00:04:36,720 --> 00:04:38,440
我倒想只是把车停在车道上
Now I would just park it in her driveway,

127
00:04:38,440 --> 00:04:40,740
可那里已经停了一台露营车 还种了很多树
but she already has a camper and a cord of wood there.

128
00:04:40,900 --> 00:04:42,320
她肯定是女同性恋
Pretty sure she's a lesbian.

129
00:04:42,760 --> 00:04:44,260
不管怎么说 这钱容易挣 对吧
Anyway, easy money, right?

130
00:04:44,880 --> 00:04:46,400
我的神呐 我什么也看不见
Oh, my god, I can't see anything!

131
00:04:46,400 --> 00:04:47,760
右满舵
Hard starboard!

132
00:04:47,760 --> 00:04:48,980
那是什么意思啊
What does that even mean?!

133
00:04:49,300 --> 00:04:51,600
我还要在这里堵人堵多久啊
How much longer do I have to block people?

134
00:04:51,940 --> 00:04:53,320
我赶飞机要迟到了
I'm late for the airport.

135
00:04:53,680 --> 00:04:55,100
迪兰 你现在一点忙都没帮上
Dylan, you are being no help right now!

136
00:04:55,200 --> 00:04:57,500
对不起 但是我自己也遇到"分流"麻烦
Sorry, but I'm already in trouble with dispatch

137
00:04:57,500 --> 00:04:59,340
我之前喝太多水了
for drinking all those little waters.

138
00:04:59,340 --> 00:05:01,206
开车 快开
Drive! Do it now!

139
00:05:03,700 --> 00:05:05,460
我要怎么告诉她 她心爱的柠檬树
How do I tell her I snapped a branch

140
00:05:05,460 --> 00:05:06,960
树枝被我撞折了
on her beloved lemon tree?

141
00:05:06,960 --> 00:05:08,240
那些叶子她是要煮来
I mean, she boils the leaves

142
00:05:08,240 --> 00:05:10,440
给她自制的靴子油添加香味的
to add a scent to her own work boot oil.

143
00:05:10,580 --> 00:05:12,780
我有没有提到她效力于两个垒球联盟
Did I mention she plays in two softball leagues?

144
00:05:12,792 --> 00:05:13,766
你们这些家伙要怎么办
Now what are you guys gonna do?

145
00:05:13,766 --> 00:05:15,240
你们是希望让你们老妈四处转转
You gonna have your mom go around

146
00:05:15,240 --> 00:05:18,680
跟这些人大喊一通 毁坏一批友谊的桥梁
and yell at all these people and burn a bunch of bridges?

147
00:05:18,680 --> 00:05:21,420
还是 去和你们的罗本们
Or are you gonna talk to your Reubens,

148
00:05:21,420 --> 00:05:24,260
凯伦们 还有你的柠檬...女士谈谈
your Karens, your lemon... lady,

149
00:05:25,079 --> 00:05:26,820
和他们谈谈你们的感受
tell 'em how you feel,

150
00:05:26,820 --> 00:05:28,000
唤起他们人性的一面
appeal to their human side?

151
00:05:29,940 --> 00:05:31,180
这选择显而易见 对吧
The choice is pretty simple, huh?

152
00:05:34,240 --> 00:05:35,380
就是说她今天不会回来了
So she's out all day?

153
00:05:35,480 --> 00:05:36,880
-我再试试打她的手机吧 -关机了
- I'll try her cell. - It's off.

154
00:05:36,960 --> 00:05:38,480
老爸说话的时候我给她发短信了
I texted her while dad was talking.

155
00:05:41,314 --> 00:05:43,240
皮娜 我给你带了杯咖啡
Pilar, I brought you a coffee.

156
00:05:43,240 --> 00:05:46,146
我往里面加了点儿料
Oh. I put a little something extra in it.

157
00:05:46,600 --> 00:05:47,620
杰 你耍坏
Jay, you devil.

158
00:05:48,260 --> 00:05:49,710
顺便说一下 你看
Hey, by the way, look...

159
00:05:51,820 --> 00:05:53,460
漂亮不
it's beautiful, no?

160
00:05:53,460 --> 00:05:55,740
这是为弗汉希欧洗礼准备的袍子哦
It's the dressing gown for Fulgencio's christening.

161
00:05:56,080 --> 00:05:58,100
我们家所有男丁都穿过它
All the men in our family wear this.

162
00:05:58,160 --> 00:05:59,540
不会又给我来个基佬儿子吧
What's one more son in a dress?

163
00:05:59,700 --> 00:06:02,440
这是传统 那可是很重要的
Oh, tradition. Oh, it's so important.

164
00:06:02,980 --> 00:06:06,600
我为小弗汉希欧准备了一个礼物 放在这里
I have a gift in here for little Fulgencio.

165
00:06:06,600 --> 00:06:09,300
这东西在我们家族里传了三代人了
That has been in my family for three generations.

166
00:06:09,380 --> 00:06:11,000
关于给孩子起名的事情
You know, about this naming thing--

167
00:06:11,000 --> 00:06:13,920
在美国 福建西欧这个名字可真不常见
In America, it's not real common to hear the name Fuljencio.

168
00:06:13,920 --> 00:06:16,500
应该是"弗-汉-希欧"
It's "Ful-hen-cio."

169
00:06:16,500 --> 00:06:17,560
-汗 -汉
- Hen? - Hen.

170
00:06:17,700 --> 00:06:20,220
我不用练这个 我不会给我儿子起这名字的
I don't need to practice it 'cause I can't name my son that.

171
00:06:20,720 --> 00:06:22,100
我只是和你实话实说
I'm just being honest with you.

172
00:06:22,640 --> 00:06:24,660
不 没关系 这样很好
No. No, no, no, no, that's good.

173
00:06:24,700 --> 00:06:26,620
这样很好 有时候我也该和你说说实话
That's good. I should be more honest with you sometimes.

174
00:06:26,620 --> 00:06:28,240
是啊 我们彼此相识也有些年头了
Well, we've known each other a few years.

175
00:06:28,240 --> 00:06:29,320
我不喜欢你 杰
I don't like you, Jay.

176
00:06:29,680 --> 00:06:32,740
我们可以看在家庭的份上 装作一切都好
nah. We can act like everything is fine for the family,

177
00:06:32,760 --> 00:06:34,640
但是 你知道的 我从来没喜欢过你
But, you know, I have never liked you.

178
00:06:34,640 --> 00:06:37,800
你那种见到好东西就要占的嘴脸
The way you take whatever looks good to you--

179
00:06:37,800 --> 00:06:41,500
比如 我女儿或者最后一块肉
you know, like my daughter or the last piece of meat.

180
00:06:42,320 --> 00:06:44,660
你总是很忙 忙到不能去机场接我
You're always too busy to pick me up at the airport.

181
00:06:44,780 --> 00:06:47,520
只派来一个完全陌生的人举块纸牌子
You send a total stranger with a cardboard sign.

182
00:06:47,520 --> 00:06:49,020
-嗨 外婆 -你好
- Hi, grandma. - Hey.

183
00:06:49,020 --> 00:06:50,340
伙计 到这儿来
Hey, buddy. Get over here.

184
00:06:50,740 --> 00:06:52,740
我是真的很喜欢你送我的十字架
I sure do love the cross you got me.

185
00:06:52,960 --> 00:06:54,360
可是我今天必须带着它吗
But do I have to wear it today?

186
00:06:54,360 --> 00:06:56,520
我的衬衫都因此扣不上了
It's kinda hard to close my shirt over it.

187
00:06:56,520 --> 00:06:57,900
不 不用
Oh, no, no, no, no, no.

188
00:06:57,900 --> 00:06:59,520
你想怎么样都行
You do whatever you want, Padrecito.

189
00:06:59,700 --> 00:07:01,260
我知道这个家里就是这种行事风格
I know that's the way in this house.

190
00:07:01,620 --> 00:07:04,340
不过你要是带上它 会让我非常骄傲的
But if you wear it, ooh, you'll make me proud.

191
00:07:04,900 --> 00:07:06,960
那已经在我们家族里传了五代人了
It's been in my family for five generations.

192
00:07:07,280 --> 00:07:08,760
-好吧 -我送你出去 小弟
- Okay. I'll walk you out, buddy.

193
00:07:09,860 --> 00:07:11,120
她家里有没有什么东西是新的
Is anything in her family new?

194
00:07:13,080 --> 00:07:14,020
就是你呗
Just you.

195
00:07:19,180 --> 00:07:21,720
好的 让一让 不好意思
Okay. Excuse me. Sorry.

196
00:07:22,720 --> 00:07:25,060
好了 我们有熏腌大拼盘了
All right. Here we've got the deli platter,

197
00:07:25,480 --> 00:07:26,780
我车里还有更多
and there's more in my car.

198
00:07:27,116 --> 00:07:28,890
但这些不是从兰伯努克家买的
But those are not from Rumpernook's.

199
00:07:28,890 --> 00:07:30,927
没错 因为我得罪他们家...
No, because the cheese at Rump...

200
00:07:31,200 --> 00:07:32,300
因为我再也不去他家买了
I don't go there anymore.

201
00:07:32,650 --> 00:07:33,970
我去洗衣服了
I'm going to do the laundry.

202
00:07:33,970 --> 00:07:36,820
好的 桑娅 好爱你哦
Okay, Sonia. I love you so much.

203
00:07:36,820 --> 00:07:39,240
你对这新管家挺有爱的哈
Wow. Pretty cozy with the new housekeeper, huh?

204
00:07:39,300 --> 00:07:40,320
她是我妹妹
She's my sister.

205
00:07:41,140 --> 00:07:43,260
哇 你这么使唤你妹妹啊
Wow. Pretty weird with your sister.

206
00:07:43,400 --> 00:07:46,360
她喜欢忙前忙后 但我挺同情她的
She likes to keep busy. But I feel bad for her.

207
00:07:46,380 --> 00:07:48,180
我拥有这么多 她却一无所有
I have so much, and she has nothing.

208
00:07:48,440 --> 00:07:50,140
好吧 人们选择自己的命运
Okay. Well, people make their own choices.

209
00:07:50,200 --> 00:07:51,400
你不需要为此负责
It's not like you're responsible.

210
00:07:51,660 --> 00:07:52,420
不 不是的
No, no.

211
00:07:53,440 --> 00:07:54,900
好像还是有一点
Maybe just a little bit.

212
00:07:55,500 --> 00:07:58,820
我比较年长 有机会出去旅行
I was older and I had opportunities to travel,

213
00:07:58,820 --> 00:07:59,900
我就抓住一切机会
and I took them.

214
00:07:59,911 --> 00:08:02,180
那也不会阻止她去任何地方啊
Well, it didn't prevent her from going anywhere.

215
00:08:02,180 --> 00:08:02,820
不不不
No, no.

216
00:08:03,660 --> 00:08:05,320
只是有一次
Maybe just one time.

217
00:08:05,320 --> 00:08:07,480
有一封来自美国的信
There was a letter that arrived from America

218
00:08:07,480 --> 00:08:09,040
提供了一个工作机会
about a job opportunity.

219
00:08:09,040 --> 00:08:11,200
但只有一人能去
And it was only for one person,

220
00:08:11,520 --> 00:08:12,600
于是我就去了
And I went.

221
00:08:12,840 --> 00:08:15,700
但那又不是写给她的信
But it's not like the envelope was addressed to her,

222
00:08:15,700 --> 00:08:17,360
你偷偷打开 然后
And you opened it and...

223
00:08:17,980 --> 00:08:18,500
你太坏了
you're evil.

224
00:08:18,680 --> 00:08:20,520
我必须离开那里 克莱尔
I had to get out of there, Claire.

225
00:08:20,880 --> 00:08:22,680
你蹬上了高跟鞋
You just strapped on those high heels

226
00:08:22,680 --> 00:08:24,660
踩着她的背走过去 不是吗
and walked right over her back, didn't you?

227
00:08:25,340 --> 00:08:26,540
好像是
Maybe a little bit.

228
00:08:27,085 --> 00:08:28,636
哪儿有小溪给我洗衣服
Where is the river?

229
00:08:31,560 --> 00:08:32,600
嘿 二位帅哥
Hey, boys!

230
00:08:33,040 --> 00:08:33,560
克里斯宾
Crispin.

231
00:08:33,920 --> 00:08:35,300
你不是应该在准备
Hey, shouldn't you be preparing

232
00:08:35,300 --> 00:08:36,780
你们的世纪大年会吗
for your annual party of the century?

233
00:08:36,880 --> 00:08:37,780
已经收工了 非常完美
It's done and it's perfect.

234
00:08:37,840 --> 00:08:39,220
我都已经开始策划明年的了
In my mind, I'm already into next year's.

235
00:08:39,360 --> 00:08:40,500
听着 我和布雷特一起来的
Listen, I'm here with Brett.

236
00:08:40,580 --> 00:08:41,720
不知道你们有没有看过他的新造型
I don't know if you've seen his new look,

237
00:08:41,720 --> 00:08:43,280
但你们肯定要被吓得心脏病发作而死的
But you are going to have a heart attack and die.

238
00:08:43,460 --> 00:08:44,180
没人会死的
No one's dying.

239
00:08:44,180 --> 00:08:46,393
-只是一种表达方式 -没错
- It's just an expression. - Yeah.

240
00:08:46,760 --> 00:08:47,480
帅哥你好啊
Hey, handsome.

241
00:08:47,920 --> 00:08:49,100
没错 我做到了
Yep, I did it.

242
00:08:49,160 --> 00:08:50,420
下定决心 烫了个头
Pulled the trigger and got a perm.

243
00:08:50,660 --> 00:08:51,900
你还真去做了
You sure did.

244
00:08:52,020 --> 00:08:53,780
我自己在厨房里做的
Did it myself, right in the kitchen.

245
00:08:54,060 --> 00:08:55,380
哥不需要花大价钱
You don't need to spend a million

246
00:08:55,380 --> 00:08:56,580
就能弄出大价钱的效果
to look like a million.

247
00:08:56,811 --> 00:08:58,979
我的咖啡应该快好了
Uh, you know, my coffee's probably ready, so...

248
00:09:00,757 --> 00:09:02,072
再见
Bye.

249
00:09:02,640 --> 00:09:04,520
他就跟个草头娃娃似的 对吧
Okay, that's like a chia pet, right?

250
00:09:04,520 --> 00:09:06,160
或许是异装癖版的"安妮"[百老汇剧目]
Maybe a drag production of "Annie"?

251
00:09:06,580 --> 00:09:07,560
其实嘛 莉莉
Oh, actually, Lily,

252
00:09:07,560 --> 00:09:09,290
我 我想克里斯宾叔叔忘了
I-I think Uncle Crispin's forgetting

253
00:09:09,300 --> 00:09:10,780
布雷特也是会伤心的
that Brett has feelings,

254
00:09:10,780 --> 00:09:12,340
所以我们应该努力不去伤害
and we need to try and not hurt them.

255
00:09:12,340 --> 00:09:14,060
对 也许我们该提醒克里斯宾叔叔
Yes, and maybe we should remind Uncle Crispin

256
00:09:14,060 --> 00:09:15,700
只有当你对人们友好时
that when you say nice things to people,

257
00:09:15,700 --> 00:09:17,140
他们才会对你友好
they say nice things back.

258
00:09:18,160 --> 00:09:19,700
好吧 多谢提醒
Well... Consider me reminded.

259
00:09:20,820 --> 00:09:21,600
得赶紧走了
Gotta run.

260
00:09:21,610 --> 00:09:22,821
好的 今晚见 再见
Yeah, we'll see you tonight. Bye.

261
00:09:22,821 --> 00:09:23,880
好的 迫不及待 迫不及待
Okay. Yeah, can't wait. Can't wait.

262
00:09:23,880 --> 00:09:24,880
他真有趣
He's funny.

263
00:09:24,960 --> 00:09:26,780
是啊 但有时候也很伤人[咬人]
Yes, he is, but he can also be biting.

264
00:09:27,020 --> 00:09:29,380
-他会咬人吗 -当然是用他的话语
- He bites people? - Well, with his words,

265
00:09:29,400 --> 00:09:31,100
不是像美术班的山德那样用牙齿咬
Not with his teeth like Xander from art class.

266
00:09:31,180 --> 00:09:32,520
我们得确认他有没有打疫苗
We need to confirm he got his shot.

267
00:09:32,520 --> 00:09:33,548
好的
Yeah.

268
00:09:33,700 --> 00:09:35,820
我的天呐 克里斯宾说
Oh, my god. Okay, Crispin--

269
00:09:36,140 --> 00:09:38,540
"太多人报名了 不得不减少参加人数
"Too many rsvps. Have to make cuts to party.

270
00:09:38,800 --> 00:09:40,200
下次再请你们吧" 伤心脸
Maybe next time." Sad face.

271
00:09:42,240 --> 00:09:43,540
因为我们拒绝侮辱别人
Because we refuse to abuse,

272
00:09:43,660 --> 00:09:45,500
他就禁止我们参加世纪大派对
we get banned from the party of the century?

273
00:09:45,601 --> 00:09:48,773
二位父亲大人需要"救父车"吗
Does somebody need a wah-mbulance?

274
00:09:49,644 --> 00:09:51,443
不用 我不需要什么"救父车"
No.I do not need a wah-mbulance.

275
00:09:53,420 --> 00:09:55,720
孩子们好啊 今天过得怎么样
Hey, kids. How was your day?

276
00:09:56,060 --> 00:09:57,820
我心里早有答案
I knew the answer to that question.

277
00:09:57,820 --> 00:09:59,700
我今天挺忙的
I'd had kind of a busy day

278
00:09:59,700 --> 00:10:01,760
四处奔波 解决各种问题
going around solving everyone's problems.

279
00:10:02,260 --> 00:10:04,980
我先去了我邻居斯塔夫罗斯的花店
I started by going to see my buddy Stavros the florist.

280
00:10:06,520 --> 00:10:07,640
你是斯塔夫罗斯 对吧
Stavros, I assume?

281
00:10:07,780 --> 00:10:08,080
有事吗
Yes?

282
00:10:08,260 --> 00:10:10,360
我是来欢迎你成为我们的邻居
I just wanted to welcome you to the neighborhood.

283
00:10:10,360 --> 00:10:11,060
谢谢
Oh, thank you.

284
00:10:11,060 --> 00:10:13,180
对了 我还给你带了点三明治
Yeah, I brought you some sandwiches, by the way.

285
00:10:13,400 --> 00:10:14,740
羊羔肉相当不错哦
How good is lamb, huh?

286
00:10:15,666 --> 00:10:17,646
-尼克斯 -我接住你了
- Nikos! - Oh! Gotcha.

287
00:10:19,040 --> 00:10:19,780
快回屋去
Get back in there.

288
00:10:20,480 --> 00:10:21,460
真不好意思
I'm so sorry.

289
00:10:22,040 --> 00:10:23,760
有什么能为你效劳的吗
Is there anything I can do for you?

290
00:10:23,860 --> 00:10:27,480
没有 没有 我
Oh, no. No. I...

291
00:10:28,520 --> 00:10:30,860
当时我突然意识到我的孩子们还不理解
That's when I realized my kids didn't understand

292
00:10:30,860 --> 00:10:32,520
以德"伏"人的意思
the concept of killing with kindness

293
00:10:32,520 --> 00:10:34,340
因为他们从未亲眼见过
because they'd never seen it.

294
00:10:34,400 --> 00:10:37,080
于是我决定证明给他们看
So I decided I'd prove it to them

295
00:10:37,398 --> 00:10:39,865
看我怎么以德"伏"人
by going on a huggacidal rampage.

296
00:10:40,617 --> 00:10:42,958
那不是戴着哈利·波特眼镜的罗本嘛
Is that Reuben rockin' the Potter specs?

297
00:10:42,968 --> 00:10:44,683
魁地大奇葩
Quiddiculous!

298
00:10:45,040 --> 00:10:46,100
听我说 哥们
Hey, listen, buddy,

299
00:10:46,100 --> 00:10:47,880
我听说了卢克叫他老师"妈咪"的事
I heard about Luke calling his teacher "Mommy."

300
00:10:48,000 --> 00:10:49,280
的确是史上最囧啊
Epic fail, by the way.

301
00:10:49,740 --> 00:10:51,460
但是 既然你是学校里受欢迎的孩子
But, you know, since you're one of the cool kids,

302
00:10:51,460 --> 00:10:53,880
也许你能劝劝其他孩子别取笑他了好吗
maybe you could get the other ones to ease off a little?

303
00:10:54,860 --> 00:10:56,120
好 隔空对个拳
Cool. Air bump.

304
00:10:56,398 --> 00:10:58,880
你好 李 我是住在街尾的菲尔·邓菲
Hey, Lee, it's Phil Dunphy from down the street.

305
00:10:58,880 --> 00:11:00,240
我们没见过面 我打给你其实是
We haven't met. I was actually calling

306
00:11:00,240 --> 00:11:01,520
想给你老婆留个言
to leave a message for your wife,

307
00:11:01,520 --> 00:11:03,680
感谢她雇我女儿海莉做事
just to say thanks for hiring my daughter Haley.

308
00:11:04,300 --> 00:11:07,100
我们想请你和你太太过来喝杯酒
Listen, we'd love to have you and the missus over for a glass of wine,

309
00:11:07,100 --> 00:11:09,488
或者我们两个爷们可以一起出去喝两杯
or--or, uh, maybe you and I could go out for a boys' night.

310
00:11:09,500 --> 00:11:11,160
总之 如果你可以...
But anyway, if you could--

311
00:11:11,160 --> 00:11:11,460
该死
Damn it!

312
00:11:13,320 --> 00:11:15,640
你好凯伦·苏利文 我是艾丽克斯的父亲
Hey, Karen Sullivan. Alex's dad.

313
00:11:15,640 --> 00:11:18,121
看看谁把牙齿整得如此洁白又整齐啊
Well, look whose teeth got so nice and straight.

314
00:11:20,020 --> 00:11:21,460
谁先说
Who wants to go first?

315
00:11:21,483 --> 00:11:22,753
-你开什么玩笑 -你疯了吗
- Are you kidding? - Are you crazy?

316
00:11:22,753 --> 00:11:25,060
你到底想干什么
What are you trying to--

317
00:11:25,060 --> 00:11:26,120
一个一个说
One at a time!

318
00:11:26,120 --> 00:11:28,030
你称呼库珀小姐为一个男人
You called Ms. Cooper a man!

319
00:11:28,040 --> 00:11:28,800
不 我没有啊
No, I didn't.

320
00:11:28,900 --> 00:11:31,100
-答录机上是她老公李 -她没老公
- I got her husband Lee on the machine. - There is no husband!

321
00:11:31,480 --> 00:11:32,320
她就是李
She's Lee!

322
00:11:32,320 --> 00:11:34,920
声音异常低沉的同性恋酒鬼李·库珀
Weirdly deep-voiced, alcoholic, gay Lee Cooper

323
00:11:34,920 --> 00:11:36,920
而你却邀请她去喝酒
who you invited out for a glass of wine!

324
00:11:36,920 --> 00:11:39,000
感谢你迷人地冒犯了凯伦
Thanks to your little charm offensive with Karen,

325
00:11:39,000 --> 00:11:40,400
她的派对内容的确改变了一点
one thing did change about her party--

326
00:11:40,460 --> 00:11:41,380
就是将我除名了
I'm not invited!

327
00:11:41,380 --> 00:11:43,480
"魁地大奇葩" "史上最囧"
"Quiddiculous"? "Epic fail"?

328
00:11:43,480 --> 00:11:45,820
现在整个学校在取笑我们父子俩了
Now the whole school is just laughing at both of us.

329
00:11:49,381 --> 00:11:51,100
斯塔夫罗斯 你好
Stavros, hey!

330
00:11:52,860 --> 00:11:53,820
为什么不行
Why not?!

331
00:11:57,360 --> 00:11:57,940
干什么
What?

332
00:11:58,680 --> 00:11:59,660
计划有变
Change of plans.

333
00:12:00,320 --> 00:12:01,260
这事儿还没完
This isn't over.

334
00:12:02,020 --> 00:12:04,860
我想让你今晚打扮得漂漂亮亮
I want you to wear something beautiful tonight.

335
00:12:04,880 --> 00:12:06,080
尽管挑吧
So please, choose.

336
00:12:06,880 --> 00:12:07,920
这屋子是干什么用的
What is this room?

337
00:12:08,180 --> 00:12:09,420
这是衣帽间
This is the closet.

338
00:12:10,320 --> 00:12:11,900
那镇上所有的居民
So all the people of the town,

339
00:12:12,200 --> 00:12:13,440
都把漂亮衣服寄存在你这里吗
they leave their nice clothes with you?

340
00:12:13,440 --> 00:12:15,840
不 这些都是我的衣服
No. These are all my clothes.

341
00:12:16,320 --> 00:12:20,120
但是 我其实很怀念家乡的简朴风俗
But... I do miss the simple things at home.

342
00:12:20,640 --> 00:12:23,500
跟我说说 村子里都还好吗
So tell me, how-- how are things in the village?

343
00:12:23,720 --> 00:12:24,620
家乡发洪水了
We had a flood.

344
00:12:24,620 --> 00:12:27,677
但不是特别严重 对吧
Ay, but it--it wasn't a bad one, right?

345
00:12:27,740 --> 00:12:28,720
我们曾有条船
We had a boat.

346
00:12:28,720 --> 00:12:30,329
那就好
Ay, that's great.

347
00:12:30,520 --> 00:12:31,740
是"曾经"有条船
We had a boat.

348
00:12:33,100 --> 00:12:34,540
你有对象了吗
Are you dating anyone?

349
00:12:34,900 --> 00:12:36,640
你记得安东尼奥·马奎斯吗
You remember Antonio Marquez?

350
00:12:37,140 --> 00:12:38,420
当然记得
Yes, of course.

351
00:12:38,420 --> 00:12:40,580
学校里的校草
The most handsome boy in the school

352
00:12:40,580 --> 00:12:42,380
有一双迷人的眼睛
with those beautiful eyes.

353
00:12:42,380 --> 00:12:44,400
我在和他的瘸腿老爹谈恋爱
His father with the wooden leg...

354
00:12:44,780 --> 00:12:46,080
洪水把他的木腿冲走了
He lost it in the flood.

355
00:12:47,540 --> 00:12:49,040
你俩是认真的吗
So is it serious?

356
00:12:52,720 --> 00:12:53,840
别看
Don't look at that.

357
00:12:53,880 --> 00:12:55,160
我不会看的 相信我
I won't. Trust me.

358
00:12:55,220 --> 00:12:56,120
他们太贱了
Please. It's pathetic.

359
00:12:56,120 --> 00:12:57,430
克里斯宾让所有闺蜜给我们发短信
Crispin's been getting all of our friends

360
00:12:57,440 --> 00:12:59,640
报告他那盛大派对的各种细节
to text us the details of his great party.

361
00:12:59,860 --> 00:13:01,280
折磨死人了 是吧
Such torture, huh?

362
00:13:01,820 --> 00:13:03,560
餐饮由阿米莉亚餐厅提供
Oh, catering by Amelia's.

363
00:13:04,260 --> 00:13:05,840
上身赤裸的泊车员
Topless valet parkers.

364
00:13:06,320 --> 00:13:07,360
-斯汀[糟透了] -就是啊
- Sting. - Exactly.

365
00:13:07,440 --> 00:13:08,800
不是 我是说斯汀也在派对上
No, Sting is at the party.

366
00:13:08,800 --> 00:13:10,480
米奇尔 人家真的好想去
Mitchell, I wanna be there.

367
00:13:10,480 --> 00:13:11,640
-小卡 -不 拜托
- Cam. - No, come on.

368
00:13:11,640 --> 00:13:12,960
别自欺欺人了 你也想去的
Who are we kidding? You do, too.

369
00:13:13,140 --> 00:13:14,260
抓紧时间啊 小姐们
Today, ladies!

370
00:13:14,320 --> 00:13:15,380
听好了 就是这句
Okay, right there. That.

371
00:13:15,380 --> 00:13:17,140
正因为这个我们必须要做出牺牲
That is why we are making the sacrifice--

372
00:13:17,140 --> 00:13:17,800
为了我们的闺女
For our daughter.

373
00:13:17,800 --> 00:13:18,860
是啊 你说得对
Oh, yeah, you're right.

374
00:13:18,860 --> 00:13:20,880
我最没资格抱怨了
I mean, I'm the last one who should be complaining

375
00:13:20,880 --> 00:13:22,100
毕竟 面对现实吧
when, let's face it,

376
00:13:22,100 --> 00:13:23,620
莉莉变成毒舌妇是我的过错
Lily's snarkiness is my doing.

377
00:13:23,820 --> 00:13:25,340
木已成舟
Well, what's done is done.

378
00:13:25,380 --> 00:13:26,700
快打扮整齐出发去教堂吧
Let's just get ready for church.

379
00:13:27,520 --> 00:13:29,440
是啊 只是很难不感到惭愧
Yeah, I mean, it's just hard to not feel guilty,

380
00:13:29,480 --> 00:13:31,080
毕竟大部分是由我造成的
you know, when it's mostly my fault.

381
00:13:31,200 --> 00:13:33,380
我理解 别太自责了
I get it. Just don't beat yourself up.

382
00:13:33,480 --> 00:13:35,400
要带手帕吗 还是不带比较好呢
Hey. Pocket square? No pocket square?

383
00:13:35,580 --> 00:13:38,760
真的吗 你觉得自己一点责任都没有吗
Really? You're taking zero of the responsibility, or...

384
00:13:38,760 --> 00:13:41,260
你想把这事怪到我身上来吗
Oh. Were you trying to get me to take the blame?

385
00:13:41,740 --> 00:13:42,480
也许有一点
Maybe just a little.

386
00:13:42,840 --> 00:13:44,820
然后剥夺你做烈士的机会吗
Oh, and deny you the chance to play the martyr?

387
00:13:45,440 --> 00:13:47,460
听着 小卡 你要是想让我来当罪人
Look, Cam, if you're looking for me to be the bad guy,

388
00:13:47,520 --> 00:13:49,340
你找错对象了 懂吗
you're snarking up the wrong tree, okay?

389
00:13:49,680 --> 00:13:52,540
你才是那个遇事不吐槽
You are the one who can't let a single situation pass

390
00:13:52,540 --> 00:13:53,640
就不罢休的人
without making a comment.

391
00:13:56,320 --> 00:13:58,420
也许我可以从今开始改变
Oh, well, maybe I'll just start today.

392
00:13:58,420 --> 00:13:59,980
我想那样会让你开心些的
I think it'll make you feel better.

393
00:13:59,980 --> 00:14:01,200
我已经感到开心了
I think I already do.

394
00:14:01,540 --> 00:14:03,420
她当着我的面就说 "我不喜欢你"
Right to my face, "I don't like you."

395
00:14:03,840 --> 00:14:04,860
没有人不喜欢我
Nobody doesn't like me.

396
00:14:04,860 --> 00:14:07,031
我是杰 人见人爱的杰
I'm Jay. I'm-- I'm salt of the earth.

397
00:14:07,460 --> 00:14:09,020
你为什么拼命闻我的孩子
Why are you inhaling my baby?

398
00:14:09,180 --> 00:14:11,260
他们只会好闻一段时间
Oh, they only smell perfect like this for a little while.

399
00:14:11,400 --> 00:14:12,960
就是这味
Yeah. That's the stuff.

400
00:14:13,040 --> 00:14:15,460
从第一天开始 我就把她当女王来对待
From day one, I've treated this woman like a queen.

401
00:14:15,520 --> 00:14:17,020
我处处围着她转
I've flown her back and forth,

402
00:14:17,020 --> 00:14:19,240
我还尝了她的土特产
I've... I've tasted her native food.

403
00:14:19,240 --> 00:14:20,560
你知道下巴是什么味吗
You know what chin tastes like?

404
00:14:20,560 --> 00:14:21,782
我可知道
Mm. 'cause I do.

405
00:14:21,860 --> 00:14:22,960
现在我发现
And now to find out...

406
00:14:24,460 --> 00:14:25,440
怎么了 我听着呢
What? I'm listening.

407
00:14:25,440 --> 00:14:27,340
你在用婴儿蹭自己
You're rubbing yourself with the baby.

408
00:14:27,340 --> 00:14:29,240
我还看过你和你的狗湿吻呢
I have seen you french kiss your dog.

409
00:14:29,300 --> 00:14:31,040
她在我嘴里找食物
She was taking a treat out of my mouth.

410
00:14:31,040 --> 00:14:31,740
那是个训狗技巧
That's a trick.

411
00:14:31,800 --> 00:14:33,180
我敢肯定你知道
I am sure you know

412
00:14:33,180 --> 00:14:35,040
我觉得这件事有趣在哪
what I find funny about this situation.

413
00:14:35,140 --> 00:14:35,380
在哪
What?

414
00:14:35,380 --> 00:14:38,580
你有一个无论你多么努力
You have an in-law who, no matter what you do,

415
00:14:38,620 --> 00:14:41,320
也没法讨好的丈母娘
No matter how hard you try, you can't win over.

416
00:14:41,460 --> 00:14:41,960
那怎么了
What about it?

417
00:14:43,100 --> 00:14:44,040
等等 听着不耳熟吗
Wait. That doesn't sound familiar?

418
00:14:46,286 --> 00:14:47,505
你不是说
You're not saying...

419
00:14:48,160 --> 00:14:48,820
我是的
Yeah, I am.

420
00:14:50,380 --> 00:14:51,760
擦 我成菲尔了
Son of a bitch, I'm Phil.

421
00:14:55,220 --> 00:14:56,720
皮娜 天太冷了
Hey, Pilar, it's awfully cold.

422
00:14:56,800 --> 00:14:58,120
你穿我的外套吧
Here. Why don't you take my jacket?

423
00:14:58,360 --> 00:14:59,860
真行 让我显得没礼貌是吧
Sure, yeah. Make me the rude one.

424
00:15:00,060 --> 00:15:01,640
很抱歉我指出了
Look, I'm sorry that I pointed out

425
00:15:01,640 --> 00:15:03,600
我们两个都应该受责备 好吗
that we're both to blame here, all right?

426
00:15:03,600 --> 00:15:05,280
但是我们不要把这么美好的事
But let's not turn this lovely event

427
00:15:05,280 --> 00:15:07,420
变成竞争好吗 穿我的 亲爱的
into a competition. Here you go, sweetie.

428
00:15:07,900 --> 00:15:09,840
你说得对 我不应该挑你毛病
Oh, you know what? You're right. I shouldn't be picking at you.

429
00:15:09,840 --> 00:15:11,220
但是别忘了去点燃你的蜡烛
But don't forget to light your candle.

430
00:15:11,230 --> 00:15:12,739
我看所有直系亲属都点了
I think everyone in the immediate family's doing it.

431
00:15:12,739 --> 00:15:14,354
好的 好主意
Oh, yeah? Okay. Good--good idea.

432
00:15:17,740 --> 00:15:18,840
那是什么玩意
What the hell is that?

433
00:15:18,860 --> 00:15:21,500
同性恋抗议什么的吗
Some kind of gay protest thing?

434
00:15:21,540 --> 00:15:23,400
是蜡烛 爸 你说什么呢
It's a candle, dad. What are you talking about?

435
00:15:23,400 --> 00:15:25,109
你的紫色裤衩尾巴
You' purple panty tail.

436
00:15:25,120 --> 00:15:26,520
不是吧
Oh, no. Oh, come on.

437
00:15:26,580 --> 00:15:28,740
我们是在教堂里 不是在夜店
We're in church, Mitchell, not some disco.

438
00:15:30,460 --> 00:15:31,740
你故意的
You did that on purpose!

439
00:15:31,740 --> 00:15:33,820
教堂的彩色玻璃真美
Oh, this stained glass is beautiful.

440
00:15:33,820 --> 00:15:35,080
在为孩子洗礼之前
Now listen, before we dunk the kid,

441
00:15:35,180 --> 00:15:36,800
我能简单说两句吗
You mind if I make a few casual remarks?

442
00:15:37,140 --> 00:15:38,220
我以为你已经说了呢
I think you already did.

443
00:15:38,740 --> 00:15:40,180
克莱尔问了我一个很好的问题
Claire asked me a good question--

444
00:15:40,360 --> 00:15:42,180
菲尔是怎么讨得我欢心的
How did Phil win me over?

445
00:15:42,880 --> 00:15:43,960
好吧 他还没有
Well, he hasn't yet.

446
00:15:44,220 --> 00:15:46,620
但是 当他不再刻意讨好的时候
But when he stops trying so hard,

447
00:15:46,620 --> 00:15:48,960
像个正常人一样 就离目标近一些了
and he acts like a real person, he comes close.

448
00:15:49,340 --> 00:15:50,960
我就应该这么对皮娜
That's what I needed to do with Pilar.

449
00:15:51,660 --> 00:15:53,180
我想告诉你们
I'd like to tell you the story

450
00:15:53,180 --> 00:15:55,260
我是怎么遇见我可爱的妻子的
of how I came to meet my incredible wife,

451
00:15:55,340 --> 00:15:57,120
因为 除了这个孩子的降临
Because up until the birth of this child,

452
00:15:57,120 --> 00:15:58,940
那是我一生中最美的事
It's the best thing that ever happened to me.

453
00:15:59,109 --> 00:16:00,320
这话听起来真"舒服"
Mm, that feels good huh?

454
00:16:00,320 --> 00:16:02,620
一天早上 我的汽车送去打蜡了
So it's morning. My car's getting waxed.

455
00:16:02,620 --> 00:16:03,680
我吃了个午饭
I hop in the diner.

456
00:16:04,020 --> 00:16:05,380
我听见了一个可爱的口音
I hear this adorable accent.

457
00:16:05,420 --> 00:16:07,740
我转过身 看见一个美女正和她朋友说话
I turn. I see this pretty girl talking to her friend.

458
00:16:07,740 --> 00:16:09,562
我送过去一个派
I send over a piece of pie.

459
00:16:09,562 --> 00:16:11,040
真经典
All class.

460
00:16:11,040 --> 00:16:12,020
几分钟过后
Couple of minutes later,

461
00:16:12,020 --> 00:16:15,060
歌洛莉亚过来谢谢我
who comes over to thank me but Gloria,

462
00:16:15,540 --> 00:16:17,560
她是我见过的最美丽的女人
the most beautiful woman I've ever seen.

463
00:16:17,600 --> 00:16:18,000
阿门
Amen.

464
00:16:18,440 --> 00:16:19,980
她坐下 我们开始聊天
She sits down, we start talking,

465
00:16:20,280 --> 00:16:21,680
从此我们就再也没停过
And we haven't stopped talking since.

466
00:16:23,080 --> 00:16:24,780
但是疯狂的是
But here's the crazy part--

467
00:16:24,780 --> 00:16:26,020
我不是给歌洛莉亚送的派
I didn't send the pie to Gloria.

468
00:16:26,920 --> 00:16:28,220
她背对着我
Her back was to me.

469
00:16:28,220 --> 00:16:29,600
我是送给她朋友的
I sent it to her friend,

470
00:16:29,600 --> 00:16:31,140
但是她去厕所了就错过了
who went to the bathroom and missed it.

471
00:16:31,740 --> 00:16:33,440
那个人今天也在场
And that person is here today--

472
00:16:33,600 --> 00:16:34,860
她就是歌洛莉亚的妹妹桑娅
Gloria's sister Sonia.

473
00:16:35,840 --> 00:16:38,040
真有趣 生命中一个小小的改变
Isn't it funny how a simple twist of fate

474
00:16:38,040 --> 00:16:39,200
就可以改变一个人的命运
can change the whole--

475
00:16:39,200 --> 00:16:40,520
你偷了我的生活
You stole my life!

476
00:16:40,520 --> 00:16:43,167
等等 等等
Wait, wait, wait, wait. Hold on, hold on.

477
00:16:43,167 --> 00:16:44,068
我抓住桑娅了
I got Sonia!

478
00:16:46,900 --> 00:16:49,820
别说了 我要我的生活 我的床
No more. I want my own life, my own bed,

479
00:16:49,830 --> 00:16:51,480
还有我的电子邮箱
my own e-mail account!

480
00:16:51,480 --> 00:16:53,260
是啊 抛弃你的亲娘吧
Yeah, leave your poor old mother alone.

481
00:16:53,480 --> 00:16:55,540
别担心 妈妈 你可以跟我们一起住
Don't worry, mama. You can come and live with us.

482
00:16:55,740 --> 00:16:57,000
等等 想清楚再说
Whoa. Pump the brakes here.

483
00:16:57,000 --> 00:16:58,760
怎么了 你对我妈有意见吗
What? Do you have a problem with my mother?

484
00:16:58,760 --> 00:17:00,260
不是 是你妈对我有意见
No. Your mother has a problem with me.

485
00:17:00,300 --> 00:17:02,720
你认为她很无助 你问问她盒子里的是什么
You think she's helpless. Ask her what's in that box.

486
00:17:02,720 --> 00:17:04,180
不是我们家祖传的枪吗
It's not the family gun?

487
00:17:04,180 --> 00:17:06,420
杰 如果歌洛莉亚有什么不测
Jay, if anything should happen to Gloria,

488
00:17:07,040 --> 00:17:08,020
我随时补上
I am there for you.

489
00:17:08,180 --> 00:17:10,200
什么 桑娅 我会有什么不测
What, Sonia? What's going to happen to me?

490
00:17:10,220 --> 00:17:12,300
你可能有一天走进你的衣帽间
You might go for a walk in your closet one day

491
00:17:12,300 --> 00:17:13,700
然后一去不复返
And never come back!

492
00:17:16,480 --> 00:17:18,280
知道自己错过什么了吧
See what you're missing? Huh?

493
00:17:20,820 --> 00:17:21,880
卢克在哪里
Where is Luke?

494
00:17:22,300 --> 00:17:24,180
站在马修旁的就是他啊
I think he's the one standing next to Matthew.

495
00:17:24,400 --> 00:17:24,780
菲尔
Phil.

496
00:17:25,057 --> 00:17:26,940
他心情不太好
He was feeling a little under the weather.

497
00:17:26,940 --> 00:17:27,720
我让他待在家里了
I let him stay home.

498
00:17:27,860 --> 00:17:29,380
也许他是觉得太丢人 不好意思出门
Or is he just too embarrassed to leave the house?

499
00:17:29,840 --> 00:17:30,980
他为什么会觉得丢人
Why would he be embarrassed?

500
00:17:31,240 --> 00:17:33,000
因为老爸想帮忙解决我们的问题
Because dad tried to fix all our problems,

501
00:17:33,000 --> 00:17:34,640
却帮了倒忙 毁了我们的人生
and instead, ruined all our lives.

502
00:17:34,860 --> 00:17:35,260
恶梦一场
Nightmare.

503
00:17:36,040 --> 00:17:37,520
你们这些小姑娘太夸张了
You girls are so dramatic.

504
00:17:37,549 --> 00:17:39,909
需要我给你们叫辆"救父车"吗
Do I need to call you a wah-mbulance?

505
00:17:43,960 --> 00:17:45,960
-你听到了吗 -当然
- Did you hear that? - Yes!

506
00:17:46,340 --> 00:17:47,920
这周都是克莱尔送莉莉去上舞蹈课
Claire's been driving Lily to dance class all week.

507
00:17:47,960 --> 00:17:48,940
莉莉全是跟她学的
That's where she gets it from!

508
00:17:49,000 --> 00:17:50,760
我们为人父母不算失败 失败的是克莱尔
We're not bad parents. Claire is.

509
00:17:51,951 --> 00:17:53,240
我说过我不会哭的
I said I wasn't gonna cry,

510
00:17:53,240 --> 00:17:54,420
但是 老天爷 眼泪止不住哗哗的
but, oh, boy, here it comes.

511
00:17:55,979 --> 00:17:58,322
不 小卡 别用这个
No, no, Cam. Not with those.

512
00:18:00,549 --> 00:18:02,055
好啦 别吵了
Okay! That's it!

513
00:18:02,320 --> 00:18:04,060
我们现在是在神的教堂 他妈的
We're in a house of god, damn it.

514
00:18:04,640 --> 00:18:07,540
行啊 所有人都弃我而去吧
Fine. Everyone just abandon me.

515
00:18:07,860 --> 00:18:09,100
皮娜 无意冒犯
Pilar, all due respect,

516
00:18:09,120 --> 00:18:10,500
你装可怜这套没人会信的
no one's buying the martyr act.

517
00:18:10,600 --> 00:18:11,400
连这家伙都不会信
Not even this guy.

518
00:18:11,900 --> 00:18:13,980
你一直将桑娅留在自己身边
You ask me, you've been keeping this one under your thumb

519
00:18:13,980 --> 00:18:15,989
是因为你害怕继续你的人生
'cause you're afraid of going on with your life.

520
00:18:16,000 --> 00:18:18,680
但你是位迷人的女性 魅力无限
But you're an attractive woman with a lot to offer.

521
00:18:18,860 --> 00:18:20,040
那或许就是个大大的机会
This could be an opportunity.

522
00:18:20,560 --> 00:18:22,880
我直到60岁时才明白幸福的含义
I don't even think I knew what happiness was till I was 60.

523
00:18:22,880 --> 00:18:24,278
打击还在继续 走吧
And the hits just keep coming. Okay.

524
00:18:24,278 --> 00:18:26,491
桑娅 我们会帮你找到自己的一片天地
Sonia, we're gonna help you get your own place,

525
00:18:26,660 --> 00:18:27,720
帮助你独立
have some independence.

526
00:18:28,040 --> 00:18:29,280
如果你感到孤单
And if you ever get lonely,

527
00:18:29,340 --> 00:18:31,460
你随时想来看我们都行
you come visit us as much as you want...

528
00:18:31,597 --> 00:18:33,008
在合理的范围内
With--within reason.

529
00:18:33,100 --> 00:18:35,360
-我们也会让这小家伙去看你 -什么
- And we'll send this one down to visit you. - What?

530
00:18:35,360 --> 00:18:38,325
但他不会当神父的 因为这家伙好色
But he's not gonna become a priest 'cause he likes girls.

531
00:18:38,468 --> 00:18:40,510
追不到女生 可是非常喜欢
Can't get 'em, but he likes 'em.

532
00:18:40,620 --> 00:18:43,020
所以 大家好好想想
So... Everybody think about it.

533
00:18:43,120 --> 00:18:44,000
别想太久
But not for too long.

534
00:18:44,000 --> 00:18:45,849
这儿六点还要办戒酒互助会呢
There's an A.A. Meeting here at 6:00.

535
00:18:47,140 --> 00:18:49,080
桑娅 拜托 让我们帮你吧
Sonia, please, let us do this for you.

536
00:18:49,380 --> 00:18:50,900
我真的希望你开心
I really want you to be happy.

537
00:18:51,600 --> 00:18:52,880
你能原谅我吗
Can you forgive me?

538
00:18:52,880 --> 00:18:54,760
需要花些时间
It will take some time.

539
00:18:54,780 --> 00:18:55,900
花多长时间都行
As much as you need.

540
00:18:56,460 --> 00:18:57,240
还要加上些衣服
And some dresses.

541
00:18:57,480 --> 00:18:58,580
要多少都行
As many as you want.

542
00:18:58,760 --> 00:18:59,480
还要加上些鞋子
And some shoes.

543
00:19:00,400 --> 00:19:01,780
你现在说的是气话
You're angry now.

544
00:19:03,480 --> 00:19:04,940
无论你和孩子们之间发生了什么事
Whatever happened with the kids,

545
00:19:05,000 --> 00:19:06,560
我不希望你心里不好受
I don't want you to feel bad about it.

546
00:19:06,980 --> 00:19:07,560
我没有
I don't.

547
00:19:09,060 --> 00:19:12,520
现在请教父教母上来
I now invite The godfather and the godmother to join us.

548
00:19:13,180 --> 00:19:14,000
别担心
Don't worry.

549
00:19:14,034 --> 00:19:15,960
明天我会搞定一切的
I will take care of everything tomorrow.

550
00:19:15,960 --> 00:19:18,180
也许没这个必要了 我的爱妻
That may not be necessary, my wife.

551
00:19:19,800 --> 00:19:22,240
菲尔与克莱尔 作为教父母
Phil and Claire, as godparents,

552
00:19:22,240 --> 00:19:23,340
你们准备好帮助
Are you ready to help

553
00:19:23,340 --> 00:19:25,440
孩子的父母完成他们的职责了吗
the parents of this child in their duties?

554
00:19:25,440 --> 00:19:27,103
-准备好了 -准备好了
- We are. - We are.

555
00:19:27,800 --> 00:19:29,040
你愿意弃绝恶魔吗
Do you renounce satan?

556
00:19:33,914 --> 00:19:35,859
-我愿意 -我愿意
- I do renounce him. - I do renounce him.

557
00:19:41,040 --> 00:19:42,660
以及他的所有罪行吗
And all his works?

558
00:19:47,000 --> 00:19:49,320
我愿意抛弃
I do renounce them.

559
00:20:00,080 --> 00:20:02,100
抛弃他所有虚空的承诺吗
And all his empty promises?

560
00:20:07,360 --> 00:20:08,680
我的天啊
Oh, my god!

561
00:20:09,980 --> 00:20:12,560
我愿意抛弃
I do renounce them.

562
00:20:14,860 --> 00:20:17,060
教父 你希望这孩子受洗吗
Godfather, is it your wish that this child be baptized?

563
00:20:18,420 --> 00:20:19,360
希望
It is.

564
00:20:34,540 --> 00:20:38,200
以圣父圣子圣灵之名
In the name of the father and the son and the holy spirit,

565
00:20:39,360 --> 00:20:40,940
你们给这孩子取什么名字
what name have you given the child?

566
00:20:41,880 --> 00:20:43,380
弗汉希欧·乔瑟夫·普里契特
Fulgencio Joseph Pritchett.

567
00:20:44,900 --> 00:20:46,720
愿上帝保佑诸位
May god be with you all.

568
00:20:47,498 --> 00:20:48,465
谢谢你 杰
Thank you, Jay.

569
00:20:48,465 --> 00:20:50,000
我们永远不会这样叫他
We're never gonna call him that.

570
00:20:56,880 --> 00:20:58,860
我听说那天有人
So I heard that somebody

571
00:20:58,860 --> 00:21:02,480
在凯伦·苏利文的派对上放了一群老鼠
released a bunch of rats into Karen Sullivan's party the other night.

572
00:21:02,700 --> 00:21:06,800
李·库珀的露营车撞倒了她的柠檬树
And Lee Cooper's camper just rolled into her lemon tree.

573
00:21:07,280 --> 00:21:08,940
卢克在学校也没有麻烦了
Luke isn't having any problem at school anymore,

574
00:21:08,940 --> 00:21:11,160
因为罗本在学校承认 整件事是他编的
because Reuben admitted he made the whole thing up.

575
00:21:11,580 --> 00:21:12,620
是不是很疯狂
Isn't that crazy,

576
00:21:12,620 --> 00:21:14,933
孩子们的麻烦全都解决了
how all our of kids' problems just disappeared?

577
00:21:15,540 --> 00:21:17,560
永远别过问我的事 克莱尔
Don't ever ask me about my business, Claire.

578
00:21:18,580 --> 00:21:19,720
你说什么呢
What are you talking about?

579
00:21:20,320 --> 00:21:21,560
别过问我的事
Don't ask me about my business.

580
00:21:21,560 --> 00:21:23,000
我没有
I wasn't.

581
00:21:23,180 --> 00:21:23,660
很好
Good.

582
00:21:24,940 --> 00:21:25,580
别问
Don't.
